  "reasoning": "The defendant Xu captured 70 protected frogs (black‑spotted frogs and golden‑line frogs) which are classified as \"beneficial or of important economic/scientific value\" wildlife under Chinese law. Illegal capture of such protected wildlife constitutes the crime of illegal hunting/killing of precious or endangered wildlife. According to the correction guidelines, the proper charge label is \"非法猎捕、杀害珍贵、濒危野生动物\" (not the erroneous form with \"罪\" at the end). No other offenses are indicated.",
